error: `direct` does not declare the capability `clock`
  --> capabilities.norn:19:11
   |
19 |     await sleep(1)
   |           ^^^^^^^^ `sleep` uses it
   = note: a written `uses { … }` is the whole set: write `uses { clock }`, or drop the clause and let it be inferred

error: `transitive` does not declare the capability `fs.write`
  --> capabilities.norn:28:11
   |
28 |     await save("./out")
   |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `save` reaches it
   = note: through `save` → `write_all` → `file_create`
   = note: a written `uses { … }` is the whole set: write `uses { clock, fs.write }`, or drop the clause and let it be inferred

error: `unreached` declares the capability `net.io` and never uses it
  --> capabilities.norn:34:19
   |
34 |     uses { clock, net.io }
   |                   ^^^^^^ nothing in the body reaches it
   = note: a written `uses { … }` is exact: the compiler infers the set, and writing one asserts what it must be
   = note: the inferred set is `uses { clock }`

